Tacto
https://github.com/Hopesy/tacto-mcp

Desktop installation and SSH bridge code originated in the Rethos project:
https://github.com/Hopesy/Rethos
Tacto adapts that code into an independent MCP package, adding its own namespace,
Node.js CLI, packaging, and installation documentation.

The installation scripts and CLI are distributed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.
CUA Driver is a separate upstream component from https://github.com/trycua/cua.
Its official release archive and applicable upstream notices remain intact.
